Third-party components

AegisGuard
  AegisGuard is AegisLab's guard pipeline: regex rules, input hardening, a pinned open guard model and an
  output check + canary scan, behind a fixed 4000 ms deadline, fail-closed.
  AegisGuard runs the open-weight Qwen3Guard-Gen-0.6B (Qwen team, Apache-2.0), unmodified, sha256 pinned.
  It is not bundled in this repository; scripts fetch it and check the pinned sha256 before use.
